  "title": "Rising Legends 2",
  "description": "[1.21.1] RLCraft Remastered For Modern Minecraft Versions! Includes all features from the original modpack.",
  "body": "![HEADER](https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Rising_Legends_2/MP_RisingLegends2_header.webp)\n[![BH](https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Rising_Legends_2/MP_RisingLegends2_promo.webp)](https://bisecthosting.cwortex.com/)\n<details>\n<summary>\n<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Rising_Legends_2/MP_RisingLegends2_about.webp\" alt=\"ABOUT\" />\n</summary>\n\n[RLCraft](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/rlcraft) Remastered For Modern Minecraft Versions! This is the first-ever 1:1 remaster that includes every major aspect of the original modpack. Designed for 100 days challenges, hardcore singleplayer and multiplayer servers.\n\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>\n<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Rising_Legends_2/MP_RisingLegends2_features.webp\" alt=\"FEATURES\" />\n</summary>\n\n* Fully Optimized with Shader Support\n* Body Part Health, Thirst, Temperature System and Nutrition. (Eating food will no longer heal)\n* Lycanites mobs\n* Dragons, Dinosaurs and Other Mythical Creatures\n* New Bosses and Mobs\n* Completely Overhauled World Generation\n* Hundreds of NEW Dungeons & Structures\n* Battle Towers and Roguelike Dungeons\n* New weapons, Tools and Armor\n* Advanced Skill System\n* 7 Dimensions Featuring The Twilight Forest, The Aether, The Undergarden and The Otherside\n* Physics for Blocks and Items (Break Animation, Pick Them Up by Right-clicking)\n* QoL Features such as Waystones and XP Storage\n* Artifacts and Rings Of Ascension\n* Multiplayer features such as Simple Voice Chat\n* Antique Atlas Minimap with Additional Features\n* Chunk Animator\n* Spawn Anywhere (RandomSpawn)\n* Many Custom Features for an Improved Experience\n* 300+ Mods\n\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>\n<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Rising_Legends_2/MP_RisingLegends2_screenshots.webp\" alt=\"SCREENSHOTS\" />\n</summary>\n\n![Screenshot 1](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/R2PHNAyg/images/28e09783f9b9e586da50ec90a96184decbc92836.png)\n\n![Screenshot 2](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/R2PHNAyg/images/bf68d55e6b0ab862931418309a3ff6d1c9afb723.jpeg)\n\n![Screenshot 3](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/R2PHNAyg/images/b97c42a4b7e56e1c981dc3a39c6c58b6d1299cd6.jpeg)\n\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>\n<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Rising_Legends_2/MP_RisingLegends2_videos.webp\" alt=\"VIDEOS\" />\n</summary>\n\nSend me your videos on Discord and you will be featured here.\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/a_wKzZtpZDY\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/RhxLy-vfcYA\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Cwortex/modpacks\">\n<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Rising_Legends_2/MP_RisingLegends2_modpacks.webp\" alt=\"MY MODPACKS\" />\n</a>\n</summary>\n\n[Open My Modpacks →](https://modrinth.com/user/Cwortex/modpacks)\n\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Cwortex/datapacks\">\n<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Rising_Legends_2/MP_RisingLegends2_mymods.webp\" alt=\"MY MODS\" />\n</a>\n</summary>\n\n[Open My Mods →](https://modrinth.com/user/Cwortex/datapacks)\n\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/NDzz2upqAk\">\n<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Rising_Legends_2/MP_RisingLegends2_discord.webp\" alt=\"DISCORD\" />\n</a>\n</summary>\n\n[Join the Discord →](https://discord.gg/NDzz2upqAk)\n\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>\n<a href=\"https://youtube.com/@Cwortex\">\n<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Rising_Legends_2/MP_RisingLegends2_youtube.webp\" alt=\"YOUTUBE\" />\n</a>\n</summary>\n\n[Subscribe to My YouTube Channel →](https://www.youtube.com/@Cwortex?sub_confirmation=1)\n\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>\n<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Rising_Legends_2/MP_RisingLegends2_knownissues.webp\" alt=\"KNOWN ISSUES\" />\n</summary>\n\n* Lycanites mobs are currently unstable, so they are disabled by default, but if you have a strong PC, you can install it manually.\n\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>\n<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Rising_Legends_2/MP_RisingLegends2_credits.webp\" alt=\"CREDITS\" />\n</summary>\n\nResourcepack: [Stay True](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stay-true) with [No Bushy Leaves](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-addons/staytrue-nobushyleaves) addon by HaiMcFly and the [Mandala's GUI - Dark mode](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode) by cesar_zorak on top.\n\n</details>\n",
